+
+Runs from a source tarball without Git, configuration, musl, or SDL libraries.
+Uses installed Khronos declarations (or already-local SDL SDK headers on
+Windows), the production guest ABI, GL generators, pointer loader and import
+thunks. This is a relocatable partial link, not a full game or hardware test.
+"""
